<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Gamified Financial Visualizer is designed to transform financial management into an engaging journey. Instead of presenting information in plain lists and charts, the system uses an interactive city-themed interface to represent different areas of your finances. Each page of the system provides a specific set of tools and experiences that work together to make managing money both practical and rewarding.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
