308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Accounts section is divided into four interconnected pages: Insights, Transactions, Budget, and Import. The Insights page converts raw data into patterns and summaries, helping you understand how your spending and saving habits are evolving. The Transactions page allows you to add, edit, or delete financial records while automatically sorting them into categories like income, expenses, or transfers. On the Budget page, you can create category-based or monthly budgets and monitor your progress against them. The Import page connects your real-world finances to the system, allowing you to upload your bank statements so that all your financial activity is synchronized in one place. Together, these pages ensure that your money is organized, traceable, and easier to manage.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
