<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Community  The Community page introduces a social element to finance. Here, you can connect with friends, view your existing network, and send or accept friend requests. Communities also allow you to interact with others who share similar goals, creating a sense of collaboration and accountability. By blending social engagement with financial management, the Community page makes money feel less isolating and more collective.)
/E (Community  The Community page introduces a social element to finance. Here, you can connect with friends, view your existing network, and send or accept friend requests. Communities also allow you to interact with others who share similar goals, creating a sense of collaboration and accountability. By blending social engagement with financial management, the Community page makes money feel less isolating and more collective.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
